01:00:45.310 --> 01:00:48.340
It's a simple frequency,
the Fourier transform.

01:00:51.830 --> 01:00:55.530
And Green-Kubo, they
didn't write one paper,

01:00:55.530 --> 01:01:00.000
they developed this as an
independent of each other.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:05.080
So this is the case for the
