01:16:45.460 --> 01:16:47.750
And they are symmetric.

01:16:47.750 --> 01:16:52.420
So that's the Hamiltonian
is often used.

01:16:52.420 --> 01:16:53.740
Why I'm saying this?

01:16:53.740 --> 01:16:57.190
Why I don't say I'm going into--

01:16:57.190 --> 01:17:03.660
